# glossary.md — Glossary template definition

## Expression

- Define semantics only; no decision explanation
- Glossary = single authority: documents reference this table; no scattered definitions
- Changes recorded explicitly

## Optional rules

- [required] Clean referencing: documents reference the glossary; no scattered definitions
- [required] Undefined concepts must not be merged (clarify first)
- [required] Term conflicts: record → user adjudicates → update this table
- [required] Sync: after term changes, sync referencing parties (zh/en mirror)

## Rule content

- Term entries: term / semantics / source state (as needed)
- Each item: trigger → behavior (short entry)

## Rule expression

- Table form: term / definition / note
- Short itemized sentences
- No decision info or references
